            "id": "721034301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那个，玄冬小姐？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721034302"
            ]
          },
          "721034302": {
            "id": "721034302",
            "speakerId": 20223,
            "speakerName": "「玄冬林檎」",
            "text": "#…啊，啊！{NICKNAME}，是您来了！您今天也要来解签吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721034303"
            ]
          },
          "721034303": {
            "id": "721034303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「胧夜正中」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721034304"
            ]
          },
          "721034304": {
            "id": "721034304",
            "speakerId": 20223,
            "speakerName": "「玄冬林檎」",
            "text": "啊…不好意思，目前暂时没有「这种东西」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721034305"
            ]
          },
          "721034305": {
            "id": "721034305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "已经很久都没有了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721034306"
            ]
          },
          "721034306": {
            "id": "721034306",
            "speakerId": 20223,
            "speakerName": "「玄冬林檎」",
            "text": "嗯，确实是这样呢。而且，也许以后也不会再有了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721034307"
            ]
          },
          "721034307": {
            "id": "721034307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你刚才说什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
